    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Decompose interspecific shape differences within clades into size/proportion changes versus topological, meristic and novel-structure changes, then estimate the fraction of diagnostic variation explained by relative magnitudes.";
